coi .ans. .i .ui sai dai do mutce snada .i mi stidi do cusku lu
coi melbi cifnu do'u mi do patfu .i ti do mamta .i mi'a mutce prami do .iu
.i do mutce dirba
li'u


mu'o mi'e cmacis

Translation:
Hello Hans, extreme happiness for your extreme success! I suggest you say
"hello beautiful baby, I'm your daddy, and this is your mummy. We extremely
love you, and you are very precious."

Maybe that's a bit verbose, but it's very exciting to hear about lojbanic
infants!

